    "fix": "the recipe disables amd_ags_x64.dll, which is the library's own absence rather than a trick: there is no AMD GPU here, so its extensions cannot work anyway. Verified 2026-09-09: with the override the prompt does not appear and the game runs. Without it, answering Yes also works."
   },
