    "cause": "shader compilation first, then a CPU limit. The Metal HUD shows GPU time of 12.9 ms inside a 36.4 ms frame, with 3080 draws and 3049 ExecuteIndirect calls per frame.",
    "fix": "settings that cut draw calls (shadows, level of detail, object density) are what gain frames. Resolution is nearly free here, so lowering it does not help and raising it costs little."
   }
  ],
  "verified": {
   "date": "2026-09-09",
   "engine": "x64-crossover26.3-r5",
